NCSN++, SDE, DSM, sampling and initialization code was adapted from that source.
Gaussian score references and their MMSE/linear variants were adapted from the
fork's mnist_compare/core.py. Face record reading was adapted from face_data.py.

The source EMA implementation attributes fadel/pytorch_ema and TensorFlow's
moving-average code. Those attribution references are retained here:
https://github.com/fadel/pytorch_ema
https://github.com/tensorflow/tensorflow/blob/r1.13/tensorflow/python/training/moving_averages.py

The source resampling layers attribute StyleGAN2, and the native upfirdn
implementation was taken from the source repository's op/upfirdn2d.py:
https://github.com/NVlabs/stylegan2
These provenance references are not grants of rights to any separately obtained
NVIDIA model weights, data, or other software.

Folder/CLI design inspired by victoresque/pytorch-template:
https://github.com/victoresque/pytorch-template
Its implementation is not vendored; the configuration and trainer infrastructure
in this archive was written for the score-SDE application.

No pretrained weights, datasets, downloaded Inception models or TF-Hub packages
are redistributed in this archive. Their respective terms apply when obtained.
This is a refactoring/adaptation, not an unmodified upstream release and not a
claim of bitwise equivalence to every source runner or of reproduced paper FID.
